# 全仓文本文件在所有平台的检出都是 LF：守卫用按行锚定的字面替换做负对照，
# CRLF 检出会让锚点不命中、把负对照判红。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资产：不参与 EOL 归一。
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.mp3  binary
*.mp4  binary
*.zip  binary
